self.KB_CONTENT["card:785035"]={"id":"card:785035","ty":"card","sourceId":"785035","title":"『固定資產查詢作業』中的『投資抵減』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"資產","keywords":["資產","固定"],"y":"other","answer":"* 1.未投抵、2.已投抵、3.不能投抵。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:785057"]={"id":"card:785057","ty":"card","sourceId":"785057","title":"『資產明細帳』中的『僅列印銷帳者』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"明細","keywords":["明細","資產"],"y":"other","answer":"* 是否僅列印已銷帳之資產。* 若勾選，表示僅列印已銷帳之資料；若不勾選，則表示列印全部的資料。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:784784"]={"id":"card:784784","ty":"card","sourceId":"784784","title":"『資產改良建立作業』中的『資產規格 (MB003)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"資產","keywords":["資產","編號","規格"],"y":"other","answer":"* 輸入資產編號後自動顯示規格資料。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:784928"]={"id":"card:784928","ty":"card","sourceId":"784928","title":"『抵押資產明細表』中的『選擇排序』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"明細表","keywords":["明細表","資產","編號","銀行"],"y":"other","answer":"* 抵押資產列印時之排序方式區分為1.依資產編號，2.依抵押銀行及3.依抵押日期。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
